  "namedChanges": [
    "src/inline.ts holds six inline copies: `tagUsedInVault` (planLinks.ts 220-228) with its `vaultIdOfEntity` (picture.ts 73-76); `useLinkLabel` (PlanValueLines.tsx 448-466); `useRecordRead` (PlanStakeholders.tsx 134-139); the two `useRelationDoc` queries (PlanStakeholders.tsx 534-540 and PlanImpacts.tsx 395-400); `usePickerQuery` (OrgRecordPicker.tsx 144-150). Each is the source's code with its free names replaced by the peers' exports; no code was changed.",
    "src/shell.ts maps the session's vault set to the rows the cards read as `useVaults` did when `GET /lws/vaults` had not answered (hooks.ts 108-125); it does not make that second call.",
    "src/provider.tsx takes the query client's defaults from main.tsx 72-76.",
    "every other member is a function a pilot unit exports, or one expression on the query client at the call site its `host` entry names (src/cacheAccess.ts, src/hosts/): `qc.getQueryData`, `qc.setQueryData`, `qc.invalidateQueries`, `qc.fetchQuery` and `useQueries`, with the key helpers of `record-cache-kit`, `lws-relations` and `plan-stakeholder-io`, and `instanceof` against the error classes of `lws-records`."
  ],
